                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.1163/875a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-03-27T20:00:00-05:00">March 27, 1939—8 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>76. A UP press dispatch from Shanghai dated March 27 states that “there is
                    increasing conviction” that recent bombings of mission properties in China
                    constitute “a deliberate attempt to destroy foreign institutions in China”.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
